Sources of the MATE packages this project rebuilds.

For each package in packaging/packages.conf:

  <name>_<version>.orig.tar.xz     the upstream release
  <name>_<version>.debian.tar.xz   Ubuntu's packaging
  <name>_<version>.dsc             Ubuntu's description of that source

Our changes are applied on top of these by packaging/<name>/adjust.sh and
packaging/<name>/patches/. Every other package in the ISO is unmodified
from Ubuntu or from Mozilla's repository (Firefox); its source is
published there.

Each release is tagged in this repository, so the tag holds the complete
source of our work for that ISO.
